https://download.videolan.org/pub/videolan/vlc/3.0.23/vlc-3.0.23.tar.xz

The pkg-config files keep VideoLAN's CI prefix
(/builds/videolan/vlc/win64/_win32). The Windows makefile includes the
headers from this tree and links the installed libvlccore.dll. It does
